  "body": "Please enter 242A West Hoe Heights, Orewa into your GPS and drive to that address.When you arrive, you'll come to a roundabout. Take the first left at the roundabout to enter the new housing development. Then drive to the second street, and you'll find the property there.\r\n\r\nAffordable, brand new and ready to enjoy, this is an outstanding opportunity for first-home buyers, investors or anyone looking for a modern, low-maintenance lifestyle in the growing Orewa community.\r\n\r\nDesigned for easy everyday living, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is bright, welcoming and functional, flowing effortlessly for both relaxing and entertaining. Quality finishes and a practical layout make this a home you will enjoy from day one.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned with easy access to State Highway 1, you will be just minutes from local schools, shops, cafes and everyday amenities. Orewa Beach, regional parks and local walkways are all within easy reach, offering the ideal balance of convenience and coastal living.\r\n\r\nModern, well presented and conveniently located, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure a brand-new home in a growing community close to everything Orewa has to offer.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned with easy access to State Highway 1, you will be just minutes from local schools, shops, cafes and everyday amenities. Orewa Beach, regional parks and local walkways are all within easy reach, offering the ideal balance of convenience and coastal living.\r\n\r\nModern, well presented and conveniently located, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure a brand-new home in a growing community close to everything Orewa has to offer.",
